# CI image (apps/s3-viewer/Dockerfile): only .output is copied; rest shrinks build context.
# Tilt image (apps/s3-viewer/Dockerfile.tilt): builds Nuxt inside Docker from source.

.git
.github
.turbo
**/.turbo
**/node_modules
**/.nuxt
**/.output
!apps/s3-viewer/.output
!apps/s3-viewer/.output/**
apps/s3-viewer-operator/target
dev/secret.yaml
